# Module Methods

> Fuente: https://laravelmodules.com/docs/2/advanced/module-methods
> Exportado: 2026-07-23 20:01 UTC

Get an entity from a specific module.

Copied!

```
$module = Module::find('blog');

$module = Module::find('blog');
```

Get module name.

Copied!

```
$module->getName();

$module->getName();
```

Get module name in lowercase.

Copied!

```
$module->getLowerName();

$module->getLowerName();
```

Get module name in studlycase.

Copied!

```
$module->getStudlyName();

$module->getStudlyName();
```

Get module path.

Copied!

```
$module->getPath();

$module->getPath();
```

Get extra path.

Copied!

```
$module->getExtraPath('Assets');

$module->getExtraPath('Assets');
```

Disable the specified module.

Copied!

```
$module->disable();

$module->disable();
```

Enable the specified module.

Copied!

```
$module->enable();

$module->enable();
```

Delete the specified module.

Copied!

```
$module->delete();

$module->delete();
```

Get an array of module requirements. Note: these should be aliases of the module.

Copied!

```
$module->getRequires();

$module->getRequires();
```
